{"Title":"An Act to expand dual enrollment for high school students in Gateway Cities","BillNumber":"S362","DocketNumber":"SD2301","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:21:24.733"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T15:21:24.7333333"},{"Id":"KWP1","Name":"Kelly W. Pease","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KWP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T10:52:25.94"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S362/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Velis, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 362) of John C. Velis and Kelly W. Pease for legislation to expand dual enrollment for high school students in Gateway Cities.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Chapter 15A of the General Laws, as so appearing in the 2022 edition, is hereby amended by inserting after section 9B  the following new section:- \r\n\tSection 9C. The department shall administer the Access College Early (ACE) Program, subject to appropriation, providing needs-based financial assistance for high school students eligible for the Commonwealth Dual Enrollment Partnership (CDEP). Such assistance shall be granted to students living in or attending high school in a gateway municipality, as defined in section 3A of chapter 23A, and who also qualify for or receive free or reduced-price lunch under the federally-funded school meals program. Students receiving financial assistance under the ACE Program will participate in CDEP at no cost and may earn up to 24 college credits. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}